ef medicaments (ऋषभौषधि).-Comp. -अन्न a. one whose food is oxen. (Ved.); उक्षान्नाय वशान्नाय सोमपृष्ठाय वेधसे Rv.8.43.11. -तरः a small bull or ox; अनुक्षणं नोक्षतरः प्रतीच्छति Śi.12.1; cf. वत्सतर. -वश a. dependent on a bull (यदि वशां न विन्देदप्युक्षवश एव स्यात्); male calf (?)", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["ukṣan", "uxan"], "synonyms_slp1": ["ukṣan", "uxan"]}], "uksala": [{"id": "ukzAla", "headword": "उक्षाल", "headword_slp1": "ukzAla", "fold": "uksala", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-sa", "senses": [{"gloss": "उक्षाल [ukṣāla], a. Swift, terrible, high; large, excellent. -लः A monkey.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["ukṣāla", "uxaala"], "synonyms_slp1": ["ukṣāla", "uxaala"]}], "uksita": [{"id": "ukzita", "headword": "उक्षित", "headword_slp1": "ukzita", "fold": "uksita", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-sa", "senses": [{"gloss": "उक्षित [ukṣita], p. p. [उक्ष-क्त]", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Sprinkled, moistened. अश्वो यमस्य यः श्यावस्तस्य हास्नास्युक्षिता Av.5.5.8.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Cleansed, perfumed.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Adult, of full growth.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Old.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["ukṣita", "uxita"], "synonyms_slp1": ["ukṣita", "uxita"]}], "uksipta": [{"id": "ukzipta", "headword": "उक्षिप्त", "headword_slp1": "ukzipta", "fold": "uksipta", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-sa", "senses": [{"gloss": "उक्षिप्त [ukṣipta], p. p.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Thrown upwards, tossed raised.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Held up, supported; तत्र नागफणोत्क्षिप्तसिंहासन निषेदुषी R.15. 83.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Seized or overcome with, distracted by, struck with; विस्मय˚ Ratn.1; so लोभ˚, अनुराग˚.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Demolished, destroyed.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Thrown out, rejected, dismissed. -प्तः The thorn apple, the Dhaūttra plant क्षणं क्षणोत्क्षिप्तगजेन्द्र- कृत्त